# Illustrated operator guide

Product screenshots ship in `docs/guide/images/`. Local dumps stay in `evidence/` (gitignored).

When editing `docs/guide/`:

- Follow `docs/guide/IMAGE-GUIDELINES.md` (Pitch Obsidian, 1440×900 PNG, `NN-kebab-slug.png`, alt names the screen and action).
- Do not commit passwords, API keys, or IRP/CCMP body text.
- Recapture into the same filename so `docs/guide/README.md` links stay valid.
- Reject spinners, 404s, and empty error toasts.
